                "explanation": "Sensory-event is supplied once, by the sidecar"
            }
        ],
        "correction_patterns": [
            "Keep each tag in one place: the sidecar or the HED column",
            "Validate rows without an onset the same way as timed rows"
        ],
        "fix_instructions": [
            "1. Assemble the annotation of each row whose onset is n/a",
            "2. Find tags that appear in both the HED column and the sidecar annotation",
            "3. Remove one of the two"
